OL,3,GNEWSAPolice treating blaze at Crumlin
OL,4,ARoad courthouse as arson
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are treating a fire at the
OL,7,Fformer Crumlin Road courthouse as
OL,8,Farson.
OL,10,FFirefighters were dispatched to the
OL,11,Fvacant building in north Belfast at
OL,12,Fabout 20:40 BST on Monday.
OL,14,FThe Crumlin Road was closed for a short
OL,15,Ftime in both directions between Agnes
OL,16,FStreet and Carlisle Circus.
OL,18,FThe Northern Ireland Fire and Rescue
OL,19,FService said five appliances and an
OL,20,Faerial appliance were at the scene.
OL,21,FThere were no reports of any injuries.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
